          "message": {
            "text": "The 16K page is a transport optimization, not a routing table: every returned value still comes from the pinned ICU helper. The exhaustive static-chain guard passed in 166.88s with this batching; 256-row pages exceeded its 180s ceiling because synchronous callers launched thousands of helper processes.",
            "markdown": "The 16K page is a transport optimization, not a routing table: every returned value still comes from the pinned ICU helper. The exhaustive static-chain guard passed in 166.88s with this batching; 256-row pages exceeded its 180s ceiling because synchronous callers launched thousands of helper processes."
          },
